      "label": "Body",
      "default": "<p>Founded in 1994 by electronics engineer Ebrahim Zmehrir, EZQuest was built on a simple philosophy: <strong>listen first, design second</strong>. Rather than following market trends, we believe every product should solve a genuine customer problem.</p><p>During the FireWire era, EZQuest became one of the industry’s early innovators, helping creative professionals transition to digital video editing. Our products were showcased by Apple at Macworld San Francisco.</p><p>Today, EZQuest designs premium USB-C and Thunderbolt accessories — including hubs, docking stations, adapters, cables, power solutions, and productivity accessories for users around the world.</p><p>Every product begins with one simple question: <strong>What problem are we solving?</strong> If we cannot improve the customer experience, we simply don’t build the product.</p><p>We believe innovation isn’t about adding more features. It’s about adding the right features. At EZQuest, engineering always comes before marketing.</p>"
